  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v0.19.0: HTML/JSX artifact preview — sandboxed iframe with React 18 + Tailwind + 17 vendored libs (recharts, lucide-react, three, d3, lodash, mathjs, papaparse, Chart.js, Tone, SheetJS, mammoth, TensorFlow.js, prop-types, …) served from a strict CDN whitelist, esm.sh fallback for unmapped imports, shadcn/ui inline shim, hooks-as-globals, and self-render acceptance. ModelPicker control with multi-model-per-provider integrated into ComposeBar and the auxiliary task selector. Continue split into its own bubble (ChatMessage.IsHidden + IsContinuation) with a reload \"truncated\" hint (IsTruncated) replacing the phantom Continue button. Document and audio attachment chips. Gemini inline image rendering persisted through .astx. Elicitation SubmitMode for external dialog hosting + required-field validation. Explicit AutomationProperties.Name on icon-only buttons. JSX import rewriter consolidated into one multi-form pass (default+named/namespace, multi-line bodies). Chat column widened 800→1100px, artifact iframe 400→540px. Public-repo prep: Korean strings translated to English. Rebuilt against Core 0.19.0 + Ai.Providers 0.7.0.",
